* A notifier `QueuePaused` was added successfully. Send it with `QueuePaused { .. }.deliver_later(&ctx).await`.
* Set SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL to a Slack incoming-webhook URL, or edit `notifications:` in config/*.yaml. Unconfigured channels are skipped.
